# Additional refspec patterns the ide git wrapper installs in repos
# that opt into selective fetching (via a sibling enable-selective-fetch
# marker at <org>/<repo>/enable-selective-fetch).
#
# Each line is a branch name or glob.  Exact names are probed via
# ls-remote before being installed; globs are installed unconditionally
# as wildcard refspecs.  Blank lines and `#`-comments are ignored.
#
# Also drives the "skip creating a per-branch refspec" list in
# ensure_branch_refspec — any branch matching a pattern here is
# considered already covered and will not get its own refspec entry.

timvisher/*
